To simplify deployment, the Cumulocity OPC UA gateway now connects through the local Cumulocity proxy running on the thin-edge.io device. Consequently, the legacy configuration options for the OPC UA gateway are now deprecated. Please update your gateway's configuration to use this new local proxy model.
